---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About | Event Tools" description="Free, fast, no-signup calculators and planners for parties, weddings, and events — built by an independent developer.">
	<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose dark:prose-invert">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">About Event Tools</h1>

		<p>
			Event Tools is a small, independently-built collection of free calculators and planners
			for anyone organizing a party, wedding, or event — figuring out a budget, working out how
			much space you need, or planning a seating layout.
		</p>

		<p>
			Every tool runs entirely in your browser. There's no account to create, no email required,
			and no data sent to a server to use any calculator on this site. We built these tools
			because we noticed that most existing options for this kind of planning math are either
			buried inside a single rental company's quote form, or scattered across outdated pages with
			no real explanation of the numbers behind them.
		</p>

		<p>
			Event Tools is a companion project to
			<a href="https://eventrentalcosts.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">EventRentalCosts.com</a>,
			which tracks real, verified event rental pricing across US metro areas.
		</p>

		<h2>How we keep it free</h2>
		<p>
			This site is supported by display advertising. We don't sell your data — see the
			<a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> for the specifics of what little we do collect.
		</p>

		<h2>Get in touch</h2>
		<p>
			Found a bug, have a tool idea, or spotted a number that looks off? We'd genuinely like to
			hear about it — see the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
